              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "Vibe coding isn't about replacing developers. It's about removing the friction between idea and implementation. The bottleneck in software development has always been translating human intent into machine instructions. AI assistants like Claude Code compress that translation layer.",
